# F组：HR与人员组织变动。仅为示例；不会自动执行。
# 将同目录 http-client.private.env.example.json 复制为 http-client.private.env.json。
# 只在私有文件填写账号/密码/密钥和测试对象ID；在IDEA选择coursework-local环境。
# 私有文件已被Git忽略，请不要把真实凭据填进本.http文件。

### F01 按部门编码同步组织
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/hr/departments
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptCode": "DEMO_DEPT",
  "deptName": "演示部门",
  "parentId": "{{parentDeptId}}"
}

### F02 按工号同步员工
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/hr/employees
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "DEMO001",
  "realName": "演示员工",
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "deptId": "{{deptId}}",
  "employmentType": 1,
  "status": 1,
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### F03 HR调岗
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/hr/users/{{userId}}/transfer
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptId": "{{deptId}}"
}

### F04 HR离职
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/hr/users/{{userId}}/terminate
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}

### F05 HR合并部门
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/hr/departments/{{deptId}}/merge
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetDeptId": "{{targetDeptId}}"
}
